WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.689
Affine Bernstein: rigid through dimension nine.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.379
Must an endless convex affine maximal graph be a simple quadratic bowl?

3
00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:09.127
The answer flips at dimension ten.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.092
Claimed: yes from three to nine, and no in ten.

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.764
Lean checks dimensions three to nine.
